# ─── Keep these ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# .tex  → always tracked (source)
# .pdf  → always tracked (compiled output / diagrams)
# .png  → always tracked (images / figures)
# .bib  → always tracked (bibliography)
# .cls  → always tracked (document class)
# .sty  → always tracked (style packages)

# ─── OS / editor noise ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# ─── Codebase folder ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
codebase/

